# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Omarchy Mobile's packages in the root image, from [omamobile] (out/repo,
# built by tools/build-packages), for every device. tools/build-rootfs adds
# the device's own package (PACKAGE in device/<codename>/device.conf) and its
# board-specific ones (ROOTFS_PACKAGES there: audio, sensors, GNSS,
# fingerprint and modem are tuned to one phone).
# Not here on purpose: omamobile-modem-sit and omamobile-mmd (no SIM run yet),
# omamobile-speaker-tuning (off by default; needs the user's extracted
# Waves libraries), omamobile-waydroid (a later goal).
omamobile-keyring
omamobile-firstboot
omamobile-omarchy
omamobile-shell
# Whisper's base.en for Voxtype, so voice works with no download
omamobile-voice
omacam
omamobile-apps
omamobile-mirror
libfprint
neard
mesa
vulkan-panfrost
hyprland
libcamera
libcamera-ipa
gst-plugin-libcamera
